{"id":"081e619277708cc0","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-numeric-turing-reduction.md","title":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction — numeric turing reduction","display":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction — numeric turing reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction","display":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction — numeric turing reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-numeric-turing-reduction","73-definition-8.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-numeric-turing-reduction — numeric turing reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a55bf7c4b509350\" href=\"?note=2a55bf7c4b509350\" title=\"73-df-oracle-machine-notation\">73-df-oracle-machine-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-numeric-turing-reduction</span><span>73-definition-8.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；数值神谕机接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^B(x)\\downarrow\">\\(M^B(x)\\downarrow\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a55bf7c4b509350\" href=\"?note=2a55bf7c4b509350\" title=\"73-df-oracle-machine-notation\">73-df-oracle-machine-notation</a>，固定其载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathbb N\">\\(X=\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 是判定归约，不是只要求存在一个相对识别程序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 为双向归约。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B)\\;\n(A=L(M^B)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;M^B(x)\\downarrow)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B)\\;\n(A=L(M^B)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;M^B(x)\\downarrow)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation","status":"resolved","id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-machine-notation","status":"resolved","id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；数值神谕机接口 $\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)$ 与 $M^B(x)\\downarrow$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]，固定其载体 $X=\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B),M^B,L(M^B)","display":false},{"tex":"M^B(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{OracleTM}(B)\\;\n(A=L(M^B)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;M^B(x)\\downarrow)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.4}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA","display":true}],"bytes":1070,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab2965eae370e771","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-turing-reduction]]；$K$ 固定为 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 中 $\\kappa=0$ 的数值对角集。"}],"outgoing":["2a55bf7c4b509350"]}